{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-01_end","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-01","title":"孤島","storyCode":"1-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"6b301b14d410218066ff3cc9532510b68d10abf780487bd3b7fdaeed9303f75c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士一行途經一家名為阿撒茲勒的診所。\n曾幾何時的交流與如今人去樓空的荒涼，勾起了阿米婭對於感染者處境的一些想法。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第七关（后）\n時間未知 \\ 天氣未知 \\ 能見度 低\n切爾諾伯格 行動組E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}營救行動 第三階段"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這個診所......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，是不是以前我們來過那個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......確實是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是怎麼......已經變成了，這個樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"已經人去樓空了......看來，是遭到了整合運動的襲擊吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這難道就是那個感染者診所，阿撒茲勒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"明明掌握著整個切爾諾伯格的地下情報網，卻不肯和我們合作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那時，他們和整合運動之間的關係也十分模棱兩可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，如果他們當時肯向我們分享情報，或者僅僅是給個提示......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也許就早點能離開這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這種下場，是他們自作自受！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也不全是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，當時和他們交涉時你也在場吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"他們那傲慢冷漠的態度，我真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不能怪罪他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"頭兒......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_ori"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者本就很難相信別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"經歷過那麼多苦難，當然會變得保守與頑固。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"至少他們那樣做......我能理解，也願意原諒他們。不提防他人，就會被他人傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，就連感染者之間，也是沒法輕易互相信任的。而且並不是每個人都願意像我們一樣冒險......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感染者診所？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......他們是一家只醫治感染者的黑市診所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"鑒於感染者的社會地位，大家是不可能在街道上抛頭露面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有些不願被拋進隔離區的感染者，依然也會在城市裡，小心翼翼地掩藏自己的身姿，苟活著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阿撒茲勒，就是向這些感染者提供服務的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......它們，一定是拒絕了整合運動的合作要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我之前和你說過，我們得了病吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......這種病，不僅會殺死我們，也會讓我們擁有不同於常人的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用法杖，就能釋放源石技藝哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，這種病，不止在生理上，會消磨我們的生命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"它也會讓我們再也不能像正常人一樣生活。正常人的社會，會剝去你的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這座切爾諾伯格城，已經是所有規則的象徵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"驅逐感染者，消滅感染者，鄙夷感染者，恐懼感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，落到如此下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，又有多少感染者，會有機會，選擇整合運動，甚至是其他的感染者組織，或者羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大多數感染者，不過是失去了所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這個診所，大概，也曾經是最後那麼幾個感染者，溫暖的家吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病是無藥可醫的。至少此時此刻，感染者只能在絕望中......痛苦地失去生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而後他們的遺體......也會成為新的傳染源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不同於常人的特殊力量，染上之後就必然會死去的可怕傳染病——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......被這片大地上的多數人所恐懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"光是這麼兩三句話，博士大概也沒法切身體會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但當你面對這些問題導致的後果時......你會明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你會明白，感染者的處境，究竟有多現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"像羅德島這樣不分彼此，或是整合運動那樣狂熱的排外擁內的感染者組織，都很少見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解你的怒氣，但我也能理解那個小診所的苦衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"可能，他們是真的碰上了什麼問題吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"至少現在，我們的怨氣，都該和這個診所的曾經一樣，化作粉塵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的各位都是好人。也許會有很多人因畏懼與敵意，相互間產生了種種隔閡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但只要在羅德島，大家一定能解開誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阿撒茲勒......羅德島，又何嘗不是一個阿撒茲勒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走吧，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["臨光"]}]}
